            <ArticleTitle>[Splenosis: a rare cause for pelvic pain (diagnosis and modern therapy with pelviscopy). A case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>57-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Definition, diagnosis, and therapy of splenosis are demonstrated by presenting a case report. Operative pelviscopy, performed twice, would be the best method for diagnosis and therapy of splenosis compared with the treatment with radiation or laparotomy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
